      "replies": [
        {
          "turn": 0,
          "kind": "greeting",
          "text": "你好呀，我是小暖，很高兴能陪您说说话。请问怎么称呼您呢？",
          "chars": 24,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "心里空落落的，这种感觉挺难受的。是不是有什么事让您觉得孤单了？",
          "chars": 28,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 1901,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "十二年的陪伴，突然离开心里肯定特别难受。它陪了您这么久，这份感情太深了。",
          "chars": 32,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 1671,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "这种习惯突然落空，真的让人心里发酸。您先别急着收拾，让这份想念慢慢待一会儿吧。",
          "chars": 35,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 1322,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "您别这么说，十二年的陪伴早就不是“一只猫”能概括的了。这份难过恰恰说明您重情重义，心里装着它呢。",
          "chars": 42,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 1305,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "它懂您的心意，这份爱没白费。",
          "chars": 12,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "您还方便吗？不想回也没关系，我在这儿陪着呢。",
          "chars": 19,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        }
      ]
    },
